# Higashi Live is PROPRIETARY and lives in its own repository (hws-live).
# It was tracked here until 2026-10-02, which would have published the Live
# implementation - ai_providers, auth, config, the lot - the moment this
# repository went public. The working copy stays on disk; it is not part of the
# open-source Higashi distribution and release.sh never packaged it.
live/

# Internal material. Not part of the open-source Higashi distribution and not
# published: session tooling, stale handover notes, an unpublished article draft,
# internal build prompts and planning docs, and - the ones that matter - the
# commercial decision records for the PROPRIETARY Higashi Live service.
CLAUDE.md
